  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">THEOD. BEZÆ</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">SARA.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>Mihi Venerande Domine, nihil magis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>placet, Quàm semper illis obsequi qua iusseris,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>Vt fas pudicam contugi nuptam suo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Parere: nec quidquam esse credo dignius,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Quàm Patris aeternam supremi gloriam,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Celsisque lucens arcibus poli decus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Totum per orbem laude summa tollere.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" type="heading" level="3" para="true">ABRAHAMVS.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Hac Vera sentis, quum melius nihil putas,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Quàm perpetuo deducere plectro carmina,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Et ora rupto solvere mox silentio,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Qua facta nimbosó tonantis athere,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Miranda canterent. Nam supero tantum placet</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Honor repensus Numini, pro commodis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Qua pleniore dat manu mortalibus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">Hic Abrahamus &amp; Sara Deum laudant.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>Sunt Patri laudes supero canenda,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Qui fauens puris bona cuncta turbis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Dat manu plena, trepidóque pressas</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">Tempore servat.</l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Lege qui certa moderatur altos</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Syderum cursus, Volucrisque solis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Vberes luftrat radiante passim</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">Lampade terras.</l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Vt fugax blando renovetur annus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Vere depulsis nimbus, sinúque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29">
      <i>Fertili</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Lower-right corner is cut off at the edge of the scan; the last word is incomplete. Some words in the right margin are faint show-through or marks and were not transcribed. Several ornamental marks in the margin were ignored.</notes>
